message: "If you use or build on MCP Pulse, please cite it and link to the original repository. Forks are welcome: https://github.com/kohli6/mcp-pulse/fork"
title: "MCP Pulse: Streaming Context to AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  A working demo of streaming MCP (Model Context Protocol): real-time events are
  pushed through Kafka and WebSockets to an LLM-driven agent that detects anomalies
  and diagnoses root cause, impact and remediation, with Cedar authorization.
  Includes industry editions such as auto insurance.
type: software
